<surname>Martin</surname><given-names>AJP</given-names></name><name><surname>Porter</surname><given-names>RR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The chromatographic fractionation of ribonuclease</article-title><source>Biochem J</source><year>1951</year><volume>49</volume><fpage>215</fpage><lpage>218</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Martin AJP, Porter RR (1951) The chromatographic fractionation of ribonuclease. Biochem J 49:215&#x02013;218 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14858313</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Plummer</surname><given-names>TH</given-names></name><name><surname>Hirs</surname><given-names>CHW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The isolation of ribonuclease B, a glycoprotein from bovine pancreatic juice</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><year>1963</year><volume>238</volume><fpage>1396</fpage><lpage>1401</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Plummer TH, Hirs CHW (1963) The isolation of ribonuclease B, a glycoprotein from bovine pancreatic juice. J Biol Chem 238:1396&#x02013;1401 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">13944116</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sidik</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Martena</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Beintema</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Amino acid sequence differences in pancreatic ribonucleases from water buffalo breeds from Indonesia and Italy</article-title><source>Biochem Genetics</source><year>1979</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>1151</fpage><lpage>1158</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/BF00504352</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Sidik A, Martena B, Beintema JJ (1979) Amino acid sequence differences in pancreatic ribonucleases from water buffalo breeds from Indonesia and Italy. Biochem Genetics 17:1151&#x02013;1158 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">540006</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>